      "id": "TbQxUwulsFc",
      "title": "Migrants caravan in Mexico walks towards US border | AJ #shorts",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-21T11:04:08Z",
      "durationSec": 112,
      "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TbQxUwulsFc/mqdefault.jpg",
      "description": "Around 300 migrants have crossed from Guatemala into Mexico, hoping to reach the United States. Their journey comes amid pressure from President Donald Trump on Mexico to curb migration.\n\nSubscribe to our channel: http://bit.ly/AJSubscribe\nFollow us on X : https://twitter.com/AJEnglish\nFind us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/aljazeera\nCheck our website: http://www.aljazeera.com/\nCheck out our Instagram page: https://www.instagram.com/aljazeeraenglish/\nDownload AJE Mobile App: https://aje.news/AJEMobile",
